| !Keyboard: freeglut's keyboard demo: shows the key and special key (with Shift,
| Ctrl, Alt) being held, and reports key releases.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set Keyboard$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Keyboard$Output /|<Keyboard$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !Keyboard needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !Keyboard needs ARMEABISupport
Run <Keyboard$Dir>.!RunImage
